  "contentHtml": "<p>작년에 복직하면서 재과만에서 도움 받아 만든 거랍니다.</p><p>탐구 보고서 (수행평가지)를 먼저 만든 후 채점기준표를 만드시면 더 꼼꼼하게 만들 수 있어서&#160;</p><p>저는 2월에 1년 수행평가지를 만들고 있어요.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>그 중 작년의 것 2개 올려요~</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c8cbbb936d9c2f956660d39e147dbcbd0b22733f?download\" data-file-name=\"앙금생성반응 밀도측정 채점 기준표(2021).hwp\" data-file-size=\"15360\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfBlk%26dataid%3D96%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20220223001014&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fc8cbbb936d9c2f956660d39e147dbcbd0b22733f')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">앙금생성반응 밀도측정 채점 기준표(2021)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">15.00KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7adaad3e5593199d53e22619db362ca0a59a7809?download\" data-file-name=\"앙금생성- 수행평가-2021.hwp\" data-file-size=\"78848\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfBlk%26dataid%3D96%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20220223001014&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F7adaad3e5593199d53e22619db362ca0a59a7809')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">앙금생성- 수행평가-2021</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">77.00KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fe007ca84c6c5a6f42683baf8ccbfc2dfa372091?download\" data-file-name=\"밀도 측정- 수행평가-2021.hwp\" data-file-size=\"79872\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfBlk%26dataid%3D96%